Exceptions and notes
--------------------
* tools/sched_ext/scx_hedron.bpf.c and tools/sched_ext/scx_hedron.c in the parent
  kernel tree are GPL-2.0 / LGPL-2.1 as required by that tree (see its COPYING).
* kernel/hedronos.config.fragment and kernel/hedronos_defconfig encode configuration
  values only; configuration is not source code under copyright (kernel
  Documentation/process/kernel-licensing.rst).
* Anything fetched at build time (pacman packages, AUR tarballs, wallpapers' fonts,
  firmware) stays under its own upstream license; this project redistributes no
  proprietary NVIDIA blob sources — they are downloaded by the installer from the
  Arch repositories on the user's machine.
